    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>This game contains some suggestive images and dialogue that may not be suitable for all ages and access may be restricted for users in certain age groups.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin Your Story with the Girls of This Epic Anime Fantasy RPG Blue Archive's world immerses you in a detailed fantasy journey, following the stories of the girls in Kivotos. This title blends anime visuals, action, relationships, and RPG strategy. Embark on a journey filled with emotion, adventure, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A Fantasy-Filled Anime RPG You\u2019ll Never Forget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a teacher in Kivotos, a fantasy city with magical schools and thrilling adventures. Guide students through school experiences and military operations. Each girl's story is part of the Kivotos adventure, creating a vibrant RPG world with heartwarming moments and unforgettable stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Lead Elite Anime Girls into Battle in this Tactical RPG Experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of elite anime girls, each designed for your tactical team. Dive into RPG combat, where every battle is a clash of strategy and skill. Each RPG skirmish is an anime sequence with 3D animations and dramatic flair. Prove your strategic genius across RPG missions in the evolving story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Foster Bonds with the Girls in Relationship Stories! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl in Blue Archive has her own story. These episodes unfold through school events, private chats, and everyday interactions. In MomoTalk, you\u2019ll unlock new sides of each girl, from heartwarming confessions to dramatic events that help shape this fantasy story. It's an RPG of thrilling action and human connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Explore an Anime-Inspired Fantasy RPG Full of Stories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world where anime meets RPG mechanics. Blue Archive\u2019s fantasy environments are home to fascinating school and girls' stories. Whether you're on secret missions, battling through gacha content, or enjoying club antics, every corner invites you into another adventure. Discover more stories in Kivotos with each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Gacha Your Way to Victory\u2014With Strategy, Epic Fantasy, and Anime Girls! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon students through the gacha system and build a squad for your playstyle. Each new girl brings strategic possibilities and stories. Your choices affect battle outcomes and story progression, turning each pull into a new RPG experience. Create synergy, develop skills, and lead your team into battle, uncovering secret episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Archive is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s an epic anime RPG with high-stakes fights on a strategic battlefield. Experience the school story brought to life by unforgettable girls in this vast fantasy world. If you crave bonds, adventure, and tactical thrills, start your ultimate anime RPG journey today.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>This game contains some suggestive images and dialogue that may not be suitable for all ages and access may be restricted for users in certain age groups.</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >=========================================================================</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin Your Story with the Girls of This Epic Anime Fantasy RPG Blue Archive's world immerses you in a detailed fantasy journey, following the stories of the girls in Kivotos. This title blends anime visuals, action, relationships, and RPG strategy. Embark on a journey filled with emotion, adventure, and unforgettable moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0A Fantasy-Filled Anime RPG You\u2019ll Never Forget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a teacher in Kivotos, a fantasy city with magical schools and thrilling adventures. Guide students through school experiences and military operations. Each girl's story is part of the Kivotos adventure, creating a vibrant RPG world with heartwarming moments and unforgettable stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/c79c67c824b999c4f5079196a2b0843f.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Lead Elite Anime Girls into Battle in this Tactical RPG Experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a squad of elite anime girls, each designed for your tactical team. Dive into RPG combat, where every battle is a clash of strategy and skill. Each RPG skirmish is an anime sequence with 3D animations and dramatic flair. Prove your strategic genius across RPG missions in the evolving story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/19025fe4e88ac60e7f6e4a72de089c95.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Foster Bonds with the Girls in Relationship Stories! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl in Blue Archive has her own story. These episodes unfold through school events, private chats, and everyday interactions. In MomoTalk, you\u2019ll unlock new sides of each girl, from heartwarming confessions to dramatic events that help shape this fantasy story. It's an RPG of thrilling action and human connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.poster.avif?t=1753921855\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.webm?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557620/extras/641357ba38d2bdd83a5d87ee406bc941.mp4?t=1753921855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Explore an Anime-Inspired Fantasy RPG Full of Stories </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world where anime meets RPG mechanics. Blue Archive\u2019s fantasy environments are home to fascinating school and girls' stories. Whether you're on secret missions, battling through gacha content, or enjoying club antics, every corner invites you into another adventure. Discover more stories in Kivotos with each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Gacha Your Way to Victory\u2014With Strategy, Epic Fantasy, and Anime Girls! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon students through the gacha system and build a squad for your playstyle. Each new girl brings strategic possibilities and stories. Your choices affect battle outcomes and story progression, turning each pull into a new RPG experience. Create synergy, develop skills, and lead your team into battle, uncovering secret episodes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue Archive is more than a game\u2014it\u2019s an epic anime RPG with high-stakes fights on a strategic battlefield. Experience the school story brought to life by unforgettable girls in this vast fantasy world. If you crave bonds, adventure, and tactical thrills, start your ultimate anime RPG journey today.</p>",
